SUMMARY:Fog Rugby Gear Exchange
LOCATION:The Mothership Bar\, 3152 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA 94110
DESCRIPTION:Swap\, sell\, or donate new or gently used rugby gear to this season's Fog players (Station 1: free gear with rookie priority\; Station 2: peer-to-peer sales & trades). Featuring drag performances by Foggers\, Mothership drink specials (21+)\, and a St. Anthony's donation drive (prioritizing men's clothing/new underwear/jeans/sneakers/sweatshirts\, children's shoes\, and unopened menstrual products). Details: https://fogrugby.com/gear-swap
